past century has been increasingly satanic, america devouring her own sons and calling it liberation and progress&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;i&amp;#39;m glad to see you list the bible first as yr favorite book mr griggs b/c if you write essays like this youre gonna need him &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ray</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/7834241955253614324'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/7834241955253614324'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305628072010#c7834241955253614324' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 17, 2011 at 4:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6893838766908651692</id><published>2011-05-16T20:32:14.335-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-16T20:32:14.335-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg, you do important work, and you do it we...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg, you do important work, and you do it well.  I can&amp;#39;t afford much, but I will help.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6893838766908651692'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6893838766908651692'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305599534335#c6893838766908651692' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1211501328"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 16, 2011 at 8:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4511071913472139795</id><published>2011-05-13T12:55:41.425-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-13T12:55:41.425-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I have often made the comment that this sort of cr...</title><content type='html'>I have often made the comment that this sort of criminal conduct within our law enforcement community only continues because we allow it to.  We, the people, possess the will and the lethality to eradicate this menace or to bring sufficient pressure on the authorities to rid our police departments of scum like this.  But we do not act because We are better than they and do not need to resort to their level just yet.  They should be reminded from time to time, however, that we are watching and if and when the time does come, we know who and where they are.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;jk</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/4511071913472139795'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/4511071913472139795'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305312941425#c4511071913472139795' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-291146872"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 13, 2011 at 12:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3175912518287842926</id><published>2011-05-11T20:49:48.346-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T20:49:48.346-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Well written,provocative and well worth the 25 I j...</title><content type='html'>Well written,provocative and well worth the 25 I just sent.&lt;br /&gt;I learn much from your articles and share them often. Read you a lot on LRC and laugh and groan each time.&lt;br /&gt;Please keep writing as long as you can. Arthur Silber is fading and we need you to remind us we are no longer &amp;quot;America, land of the free, home of the brave&amp;quot; home of the slave, land of the knave is more accurate today.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3175912518287842926'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3175912518287842926'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305168588346#c3175912518287842926' title=''/><author><name>Brian</name><uri>http://Brianholk.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1226550068"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 8:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2308696511240546638</id><published>2011-05-11T17:10:41.462-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T17:10:41.462-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Did i leave a link to the chipin page? I forget......</title><content type='html'>Did i leave a link to the chipin page? I forget...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyway, it&amp;#39;s: &lt;br /&gt;http://supportwillgrigg.chipin.com/mypages/view/id/1c2b045a7b0d8265</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2308696511240546638'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2308696511240546638'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305155441462#c2308696511240546638' title=''/><author><name>JohnS</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2059194967"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 5:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2672341089485557493</id><published>2011-05-11T16:45:51.943-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T16:45:51.943-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Man, I just noticed that your show is back on LNR!...</title><content type='html'>Man, I just noticed that your show is back on LNR! And they&amp;#39;ve added Larken Rose, too... very cool.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyway, on to more pressing concerns-feeding your family! I&amp;#39;m making a chipin page for you right now- I hope $25k is both a)enough, and b) not presumptuous. I intend to troll (fishing, not being an ass) all my usual web haunts with it. With a light touch, no need to cringe &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here&amp;#39;s the URL for the chipin page:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://supportwillgrigg.chipin.com/mypages/view/id/1c2b045a7b0d8265&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I put your paypal address into it as the destination, so... hehe, lets see what happens. I&amp;#39;ll sweeten the pot a bit before I begin posting links hither and yon...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;best of luck my friend.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;John&lt;br /&gt;Live Oak, FL</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2672341089485557493'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2672341089485557493'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305153951943#c2672341089485557493' title=''/><author><name>JohnS</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2059194967"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 4:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3107529253271568249</id><published>2011-05-11T14:36:24.672-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T14:36:24.672-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My finances are exhausted, since I have been out o...</title><content type='html'>My finances are exhausted, since I have been out of work for so long, but I sent the word out via Facebook and I hope that you will do some radio show fill ins as you are a very convincing speaker, like perhaps the Infowars or Prison Planet tv show. Books do not pay very well, and I know you do have Liberty Eclipsed published already. The body Ventura could use your research too, since he is on a TV show doing expose&amp;#39; s.  You lost me a while back on the illegal immigration debate, but, since all that has happened since, I ask myself, who wants a friggin wall on the border, when we all want to escape this police state on steroids? Love to you and your magnificent 7 family</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3107529253271568249'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3107529253271568249'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305146184672#c3107529253271568249' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-683188793"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 2:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6916848600116633989</id><published>2011-05-11T12:54:16.809-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T12:54:16.809-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Also I am very happy that your podcasts are on Lib...</title><content type='html'>Also I am very happy that your podcasts are on Liberty News Radio again. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pleased contributor</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6916848600116633989'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6916848600116633989'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305140056809#c6916848600116633989' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-39077828"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 12:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7975565261877928539</id><published>2011-05-11T11:21:21.720-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T11:21:21.720-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I think you might have made a mistake: you introdu...</title><content type='html'>I think you might have made a mistake: you introduce Jon Bartlett, and Frank Jude, and later refer to a Frank Jude Bartlett, in a sentence that left me thoroughly confused... but anyway, great job exposing police brutality</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/7975565261877928539'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/7975565261877928539'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305134481720#c7975565261877928539' title=''/><author><name>Juliano VL</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07326482121741997522</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-130452370"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 11:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4083642824995661212</id><published>2011-05-11T11:15:08.725-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T11:15:08.725-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another aspect of the prison industry:  Sending yo...</title><content type='html'>Another aspect of the prison industry:  Sending young, impressionable folks to prison is like sending them to &amp;quot;crime school&amp;quot;. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-Vickie</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/4083642824995661212'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/4083642824995661212'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305134108725#c4083642824995661212' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-39077828"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 11:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2762316164690682897</id><published>2011-05-11T10:39:19.181-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T10:39:19.181-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, lots of writers have released compilations o...</title><content type='html'>Will, lots of writers have released compilations of previous material.  That&amp;#39;s what Rush Limbaugh&amp;#39;s books were, and they were best sellers.  You have tons of material to which you already own the copyright.  Probably enough to fill 2 or 3 books at least.  Surely they&amp;#39;re worth $19.95 apiece.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2762316164690682897'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/2762316164690682897'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305131959181#c2762316164690682897' title=''/><author><name>Lloyd</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01414099797270656976</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-463706328"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 10:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6349402519440809003</id><published>2011-05-11T07:47:57.835-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T07:47:57.835-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The &amp;quot;money bomb&amp;quot; idea is great, but I wo...</title><content type='html'>The &amp;quot;money bomb&amp;quot; idea is great, but I wonder why you don&amp;#39;t write a book about all this. You already have tons of material for it.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Probably would sell well. :)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6349402519440809003'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/6349402519440809003'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305121677835#c6349402519440809003' title=''/><author><name>MamaLiberty</name><uri>http://www.thepriceofliberty.org</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-659421199"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 7:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3037798932793741610</id><published>2011-05-11T05:52:21.793-06:00</published><updated>2011-05-11T05:52:21.793-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Kenneth McDuff , murderer, spent time on Death Row...</title><content type='html'>Kenneth McDuff , murderer, spent time on Death Row from 1968-72, in jail &amp;#39;til 1989.&lt;br /&gt;He got off the death sentence as I think the death penalty was stopped for a while, nevertheless he twice went to the chair but received last-minute stays.&lt;br /&gt; In 1989 , due to prison-overcrowding he was set free and after 3 days killed someone. Later he violated parole , went back inside, to be released in Dec 1990.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;@ years later he was finally arrested after murdering a few more people.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ll leave the last word to Wiki:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;After McDuff&amp;#39;s second arrest for murder in 1992, Texas launched a massive overhaul of its prison system to prevent violent criminals from winning early parole. The tightened parole rules, extensive prison building projects and improved monitoring of violent parolees are collectively known in Texas as the McDuff Laws.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Serial-Killers: Handy things to have around when there&amp;#39;s all that &amp;#39;business&amp;#39; at stake.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What&amp;#39;s seriously ironic is that the new prisons are probably in better condition than many homes as are office spaces. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Have read the posts since the Godboldo article - well written, informative and important.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;RE: Your future income - a 25-man prison in your back garden :)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;cheers</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3037798932793741610'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3675188306153170469/comments/default/3037798932793741610'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html?showComment=1305114741793#c3037798932793741610' title=''/><author><name>aferrismoon</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10323962086698914361</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/05/worlds-largest-street-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3675188306153170469' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3675188306153170469' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-857622170"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 11, 2011 at 5:52 AM"/></entry></feed>